    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-8770fb1e-8331-47fa-9d28-687e4832b223",
        "text": "<p>The African masks portray a strong visual of a face with an expression on them. It was made clear from the beginning that the brand will avoid a print containing literal faces on it. Thus the challenge in developing a collection inspired by this theme was to strike a balance between achieving the essence of the inspiration but not be visually exact to a face or face mask. While exploring, the idea of having hidden masks in the motifs made with patterns was conceived. Based on this idea various illustrations of different motifs were developed</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
    },
